comment.narrative:
99 percent of the debt service payments are done semi-annually. Budgetary Central Government (BCG) debt are reconciled every time a debt service payment is processed; hence it eliminates the need to do a separate quarterly reconciliation. Domestic debt is also reported.

Currently publishing quarterly on the MoF website. Reporting as per IMF standards including recording of domestic debt started from Q1 of 2020 onwards. Submitted up to Q2 of 2021.

