HIES 2019 is available on MBS&rsquo; website in its complete form, along with infographics for specific sections -&nbsp;https://statisticsmaldives.gov.mv/hies-2019/

Gender disaggregated statistics are available on the MBS website. Micro data available for download supports gender focused analyses at household and individual level. Capacity building trainings for MBS staff have been organized under the SL/MV Poverty Monitoring program, while the project has funded data collection for HIES 2019 fieldwork, and the 2 rounds of COVID-19 impacts.&nbsp;

Completing&nbsp;analysis of round 1 and round 2 to publish a standalone report along wih gender-disaggregated statistics on how COVID-19 has affected work participation among males and females and whether there is any recovery between round 1 and round 2.
